meta {
  name: Day Events (all punches)
  type: http
  seq: 30
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/hr/attendance/events?user_id={{targetUserId}}&date=2026-07-15
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  user_id: {{targetUserId}}
  date: 2026-07-15
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

docs {
  Every punch of one employee's work date. The team view carries only the day's
  first check-in and last check-out, which hides a split shift's middle punches —
  this is the only way to reach them and their selfies. Gated by
  hr.attendance.photo.view, the same capability as the photos it leads to.
}
